    <!--
        Home screen, sized for the shortest screens (under 240dp tall, where a 480x240 unit at
        mdpi lands once the system bars are taken out). A height qualifier means "at least", so
        these are the smallest sizes and values-h320dp, values-h360dp and values-w400dp-h520dp
        grow them step by step. At this size the widget row is left out on purpose (its minimum is
        above what is left over), and the main button keeps everything it needs.
    -->
